{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-fleet/src/content.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-28T01:00:19.025027Z","id":"f9b15021b704fdc54b987ff48b0f3cbbb2164b38b1b300a745986d2d63af97f2","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:347050368","summary":"PgContent::read_file and read_asset are one typed query outside any transaction, and what is read or written is kept in a 64 MiB byte-bounded cache (content::Cache, test the_cache_keeps_its_byte_bound_and_forgets_by_artifact). Streaming files larger than 4 MiB from PostgreSQL is not done. `bazel test //crates/clax-fleet/... //crates/clax-pagevfs/...` all PASSED (integration 17 tests, library 15, binary 3, pagevfs 8)","supersedes":"96d24b7c91f612c8b44b3ba6c21214a9b38f02d1cd3e9b05292e4e695b67bb49","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:52195316-c20b-49ba-9ad3-4026c7d5a1e0"]}}
